{"reason": "The item is a dry bag, which is on the list of returnable items. The delivery was 9 days ago, and 9 < 90, so the item is returnable. Restocking fee: 18% of $250 = $45. Refund: $250 - $45 = $205.", "decision": "return", "fee_percent": 18, "refund": 205}
